cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use TALOS in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "TALOS: Transfer and Alignment Laboratory Operating System"
abstract: >-
  Integrated hardware control, computer vision and automation for 2D-material
  transfer and stacking benches: one desktop application driving a motorised XYR
  sample stage, a transfer stage, a motorised focus axis, a hot stage and a
  microscope camera, with autofocus, flake detection, grid scanning and a
  hardware abstraction layer that makes the application adaptable to different
  instruments.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Lewbert"
    email: "lewbert@connect.hku.hk"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Lewbert/talos-2d-transfer"
license: GPL-3.0-only
version: 0.1.0
keywords:
  - 2D materials
  - transfer
  - stacking
  - microscope control
  - autofocus
  - laboratory automation
  - instrumentation
